":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-25T16:49:38-07:00","id":921228,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/921070-hows-good-a-defense-does-the-delerium-give-the-veil#post921070\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">thought about it, had one player who I was only tenative showing the game who ranted a lot about how SATELITES should find all garou and the government allready has a a paramilitary force in place to contain supernaturals, yatta yatta yatta...<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>The Government organization that is in place with Paramilitary force to contain supernaturals is called &quot;The Technocracy&quot;, They've had serious funding issues as of late and had to limit their killbot initiatives to just the most extreme mages. <br /> <br /> Of course this has no effect on Pentex and its subsidiaries which I am sure do not include many tech companies looking for garou fuckups... <br /> <br /> The Veil isn't about whether people will believe in werewolves in this day and age. The Delerium covers that. the Veil is about not getting your friends and family killed by Pentex Assassins while you go off in the Umbra.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-25T23:41:05-07:00","id":921376,"title":"","content":"That makes me wonder. Would the Technocracy see pentex as a threat??","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T05:44:04-07:00","id":921450,"title":"","content":"Depends how much they learn about pentex and its plans.<br /> <br /> Would they if they understood EVERYTHING about Pentexes Omega plan... see it as a threat? yes.<br /> <br /> worse then the traditions. and respond accordingly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T06:33:20-07:00","id":921464,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>garhkal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/921070-hows-good-a-defense-does-the-delerium-give-the-veil?p=921376#post921376\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That makes me wonder. Would the Technocracy see pentex as a threat??</div> </div> </div> </div>The Technocracy and Pentex are <i>allies</i>. Of course, most of the Technocracy is unaware of this, and if they knew they'd clean house on the Syndicate and probably launch a first strike against Pentex, but as far as anyone outside the Syndicate knows, Pentex is just a Multinational Holding Corporation with really really good lawyers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T11:03:33-07:00","id":921569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>etherial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/921070-hows-good-a-defense-does-the-delerium-give-the-veil?p=921464#post921464\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Technocracy and Pentex are <i>allies</i>. Of course, most of the Technocracy is unaware of this, and if they knew they'd clean house on the Syndicate and probably launch a first strike against Pentex, but as far as anyone outside the Syndicate knows, Pentex is just a Multinational Holding Corporation with really really good lawyers.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I wouldn't say they are allies. I'd say the Majority of the Technocracy has never heard of Pentex those who have some idea are sure its under Syndicate control(even other members of the Syndicate). What Project Invictus knows... is well there's a reason Project Invictus is going after the Syndicate.. there's a reason the Technocracy is on the brink of Civil War between the NWO and the Syndicate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T12:28:59-07:00","id":921622,"title":"","content":"Perhaps a group of shifters could toss some wrenches in the works and actually expose pentex to the NWO as a way to put a smack on both them and the syndicate..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":